# rendered-page receipts for a branch under review. The merge gate here is a
# human looking at the page (2026-07-10), so the shots live beside the branch
# that produced them — but they are a receipt of one build against one store,
# not a fixture, and nothing rebuilds them. They stay out of the repo's history.
review/
.omx/
public/atelier/the-resident-herbarium/

# QA shots are artifacts, never repo content (founder, 2026-09-01 — 103M of
# pixels had accumulated since 08-14). Harness scripts (*.mjs, *.html) stay
# tracked; the pixels go to the Starstory day docs.
qa-shots/**/*.png
qa-shots/**/*.jpg
qa-shots/**/*.jpeg
qa-shots/**/*.webp
qa-shots/**/*.gif
